  "title": "Spaghetti Carbonara I",
  "description": "Fry up some bacon and scrambled eggs, then toss with cooked spaghetti, olive oil and Parmesan cheese for a quick, savory meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Marian Collins"
  ],
